{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Fantasy is a roguelike tactical SRPG featuring build customization and fast-paced turn-based combat.<br>In a world shrouded by eternal night, players will lead three adventurers to climb the Demon Tower, defeat the Demon Lord, and bring long-lost light back to the land.<br>Each adventure starts from zero. As the journey progresses, you will continuously collect <strong>skills, classes, talents, and relics</strong> to build a unique team of heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052850/extras/e48e9c53dd85513d84e5eb4bbaea284f.poster.avif?t=1764676680\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052850/extras/e48e9c53dd85513d84e5eb4bbaea284f.webm?t=1764676680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052850/extras/e48e9c53dd85513d84e5eb4bbaea284f.mp4?t=1764676680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactics meets Roguelike</strong>: Grid-based battles combined with random progression for a unique experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multi-action excitement</strong>: Characters can act multiple times in a single turn, creating fast-paced and thrilling combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multi-layered growth</strong>: Skills, spirits, ultimates, and talents can be freely combined to form diverse playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classes and promotions</strong>: Progress from basic to advanced classes to unlock deeper tactical possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High replayability</strong>: Random routes and diverse events ensure every adventure feels fresh.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052850/extras/4325c1014dd15d8b4305ebf5b790b68a.poster.avif?t=1764676680\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052850/extras/4325c1014dd15d8b4305ebf5b790b68a.webm?t=1764676680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052850/extras/4325c1014dd15d8b4305ebf5b790b68a.mp4?t=1764676680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Overview</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three-person squad</strong>: Control three characters at once, spending RAP (action points) to perform multiple actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battlefield strategy</strong>: Terrain, enemy placement, and turn order have a major impact on tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relics and items</strong>: Relics grant lasting benefits to the entire team, while items must be used wisely depending on the situation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052850/extras/7b2c5afac90378c7561ce546c8ac2812.poster.avif?t=1764676680\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052850/extras/7b2c5afac90378c7561ce546c8ac2812.webm?t=1764676680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052850/extras/7b2c5afac90378c7561ce546c8ac2812.mp4?t=1764676680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Elements</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal attack</strong>: Reliable and scales well over time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skills</strong>: Actively cast abilities with varied functions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spirits</strong>: Provide healing, shields, and buffs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultimates</strong>: Wide-ranged, powerful abilities that can turn the tide of battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talents</strong>: Permanent passives that shape personalized combat styles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052850/extras/d866642d9f634fd7a6bd1e61def9660a.poster.avif?t=1764676680\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052850/extras/d866642d9f634fd7a6bd1e61def9660a.webm?t=1764676680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052850/extras/d866642d9f634fd7a6bd1e61def9660a.mp4?t=1764676680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta-Progression</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random routes</strong>: Encounter battles, events, shops, and bosses throughout the journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Growth and building</strong>: Earn new abilities after victories to gradually expand team combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk and choice</strong>: Every run brings opportunities and dangers, ensuring long-term replay value.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Official Discord \u2013 <strong>Night Fantasy Community</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here you can talk about the game, share your ideas, and get early access to test builds and the latest updates.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4052850?t=1764676680","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052850/c3a695e554ecfb109b5509db424135fae3008db2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764676680","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052850/d466b457724c8c6503963e94b03f09fad72eb5e9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764676680","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052850/d466b457724c8c6503963e94b03f09fad72eb5e9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764676680","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Fantasy is a roguelike tactical SRPG featuring build customization and fast-paced turn-based combat.<br>In a world shrouded by eternal night, players will lead three adventurers to climb the Demon Tower, defeat the Demon Lord, and bring long-lost light back to the land.<br>Each adventure starts from zero. As the journey progresses, you will continuously collect <strong>skills, classes, talents, and relics</strong> to build a unique team of heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052850/extras/e48e9c53dd85513d84e5eb4bbaea284f.poster.avif?t=1764676680\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052850/extras/e48e9c53dd85513d84e5eb4bbaea284f.webm?t=1764676680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052850/extras/e48e9c53dd85513d84e5eb4bbaea284f.mp4?t=1764676680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactics meets Roguelike</strong>: Grid-based battles combined with random progression for a unique experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multi-action excitement</strong>: Characters can act multiple times in a single turn, creating fast-paced and thrilling combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multi-layered growth</strong>: Skills, spirits, ultimates, and talents can be freely combined to form diverse playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classes and promotions</strong>: Progress from basic to advanced classes to unlock deeper tactical possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High replayability</strong>: Random routes and diverse events ensure every adventure feels fresh.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052850/extras/4325c1014dd15d8b4305ebf5b790b68a.poster.avif?t=1764676680\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052850/extras/4325c1014dd15d8b4305ebf5b790b68a.webm?t=1764676680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052850/extras/4325c1014dd15d8b4305ebf5b790b68a.mp4?t=1764676680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Overview</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three-person squad</strong>: Control three characters at once, spending RAP (action points) to perform multiple actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battlefield strategy</strong>: Terrain, enemy placement, and turn order have a major impact on tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relics and items</strong>: Relics grant lasting benefits to the entire team, while items must be used wisely depending on the situation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052850/extras/7b2c5afac90378c7561ce546c8ac2812.poster.avif?t=1764676680\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052850/extras/7b2c5afac90378c7561ce546c8ac2812.webm?t=1764676680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052850/extras/7b2c5afac90378c7561ce546c8ac2812.mp4?t=1764676680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Elements</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal attack</strong>: Reliable and scales well over time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skills</strong>: Actively cast abilities with varied functions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spirits</strong>: Provide healing, shields, and buffs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultimates</strong>: Wide-ranged, powerful abilities that can turn the tide of battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talents</strong>: Permanent passives that shape personalized combat styles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052850/extras/d866642d9f634fd7a6bd1e61def9660a.poster.avif?t=1764676680\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052850/extras/d866642d9f634fd7a6bd1e61def9660a.webm?t=1764676680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052850/extras/d866642d9f634fd7a6bd1e61def9660a.mp4?t=1764676680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta-Progression</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random routes</strong>: Encounter battles, events, shops, and bosses throughout the journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Growth and building</strong>: Earn new abilities after victories to gradually expand team combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk and choice</strong>: Every run brings opportunities and dangers, ensuring long-term replay value.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Official Discord \u2013 <strong>Night Fantasy Community</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here you can talk about the game, share your ideas, and get early access to test builds and the latest updates.</p>","developers":["SpringLeaf"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052850/9eebafb7d223d5f822448dd74c428ee73b94ee97/header.jpg?t=1764676680","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 SpringLeaf.All Rights reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4052850/801313208/d3f90d6657daf334cdf9e8d65e311e9ad80c76dc/1764478410/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764479426","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4052850/801313208/d3f90d6657daf334cdf9e8d65e311e9ad80c76dc/1764478410/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764479426","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4052850/801313208/d3f90d6657daf334cdf9e8d65e311e9ad80c76dc/1764478410/hls_264_master.